From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:48:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add LICENSE.filereaderlp for the vendored filereaderlp
 sources

dimod/cylp.pyx compiles extern/filereaderlp's reader.cpp straight into the
cylp extension to parse LP files; that vendored code is MIT-licensed
(Copyright (c) 2020 Michael Feldmeier), distinct from dimod's own
Apache-2.0 licence, but its LICENSE lives under extern/filereaderlp/ rather
than the project root, so setuptools' default license_files glob
(LICEN[CS]E*) never picks it up and the built wheel ships only
dist-info/licenses/LICENSE. Adding a verbatim copy at the root as
LICENSE.filereaderlp needs no setup.cfg/pyproject.toml change: it matches
the default glob and lands in dist-info/licenses/ alongside the original.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [licensing completeness for the wheels we redistribute; not a functional change upstream needs]
---
 LICENSE.filereaderlp | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 LICENSE.filereaderlp

diff --git a/LICENSE.filereaderlp b/LICENSE.filereaderlp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8ec8b60
--- /dev/null
+++ b/LICENSE.filereaderlp
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
